{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>ShiftFlow 是一款為輪班工作者而設的離線日曆，讓你依照自己的班表建立重複的輪班循環，將工作日、夜班與休息日放在同一個畫面上。無論是日夜輪替、跨夜值班，或需要向家人交代行程的人，都能藉此整理作息。軟件原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-169.webp\">\n<h2>自訂輪班循環與提醒</h2>\n<p>可依序加入日班、夜班與休息日，建立最多 20 種班別、長達 60 天的輪班循環。改動個別日期班別時可加上備註，班表支援跨夜工作。本地提醒可於班次開始前 15 至 120 分鐘發出，亦可分享當月班表圖片。統計頁按月、年或自訂期間顯示班次與休息日。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-190-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-191-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-192-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-193-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-194-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：ShiftFlow: Rotation Calendar</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:54.347674+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":322,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T22:09:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T07:17:40.256653+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:47.265274+00:00","content_hash":"66cc23231acf9d75afd298f0293707adb379c7dbdb0cf83b561fa42f6e634af9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}